thinkcell provides  graphics software  that performs most of the painstaking work of creating data-driven slides for professional Excel and PowerPoint users. The testing department makes sure that new features are technically sound and work reliably for all user groups, from new users to seasoned financial professionals.&nbsp;

&nbsp;

What you will do &nbsp;

As a Test Engineer at thinkcell, you'll help improve a product that over 1,000,000 professionals around the world rely on every day.

Testing and verifying new features is an important part of the job, as our product continues to evolve. Since think-cell is seamlessly integrated into Microsoft PowerPoint and Excel, we must pay close attention to its compatibility with supported Microsoft Office versions, operating systems, and their respective updates.

There is a certain level of complexity to our product and consequently to the testing process. Problem-solving skills are important as well as keeping an overview between verifying fixes, creating test cases, and ensuring our users receive only top quality.&nbsp;

&nbsp;

